OL,3,GNEWSAVandalism to eight greens closes
OL,4,Agolf course
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public golf course has been forced to
OL,7,Fclose after eight of its greens were
OL,8,Fvandalised.
OL,10,FHertfordshire Police said it was
OL,11,Finvestigating "a criminal damage
OL,12,Fincident" which happened between 18:00
OL,13,FGMT on Wednesday and 06:00 on Thursday
OL,14,Fat Cheshunt Park Golf Course.
OL,16,FIn a statement, Broxbourne Borough
OL,17,FCouncil, which owns the course, said
OL,18,Fthose responsible had broken in through
OL,19,Fthe railings.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
