OL,3,GNEWSAVandalism to eight greens closes
OL,4,Agolf course
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said "significant damage"
OL,7,Fhad been caused on the 3rd, 4th, 5th,
OL,8,F10th, 11th, 12th, 13th and 15th holes.
OL,9,FThe circular cuts appear to have been
OL,10,Fmade by people on quad bikes.
